    "text": "newportdispatch.com\nwebsite\nColebrook\nColebrook man arrested on drug charges after traffic stop\nBy Daniel Duric,\n2 hours agoCOLEBROOK — A 31-year-old Colebrook man was arrested on multiple drug charges following a traffic stop on Corliss Lane on Aug. 11. Lucas Randlett was charged with three counts of possession of controlled drug, transportation of drugs in a motor vehicle, misuse of plates, unregistered vehicle and uninspected vehicle.",
